  "description": "Tactical Edition - ECLIPSE - one of one.\n\nInspired by DJ Cary Chang, one of YYC's legendary DJs and the inventor of the GTREX concept. This bike is murdered out, made light, and designed to ride all night. More below.\n\nECLIPSE\n\nBorn from the moment the moon swallowed the sun, Eclipse is a machine for those who ride on the edge of the trance. Its geometry is a spell — a frame pulled tight like a bowstring, ready to launch you through blunted clouds of thundering dub, each pedal stroke in pulse with the bassline of the earth. This bike isn’t built for straight lines or sober commutes. It’s for tracing spirals through dark forest horns perfumed with the heady musk of autumn leaves, for trailing spliff smoke through alleyways where the night snaps to your rhythm. Its trail-born grit wrapped in dream logic summons gatherings under park gazebos where bottles pop and laughter sizzles like hi-hats. Eclipse doesn’t just roll deep — it cycles you through lunar moods. You’ll feel it in your spine when the trail bends and the world blurs, a mad synchrony of body, sight, and sound. Ride it like you mean to disappear and reappear somewhere stranger, grinning wider than you should.\n\nGTREX ECLIPSE 2025",
